WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.071 --> 00:00:08.367
Roxy looked at the robots. "Cozlin! Do something!"

2
00:00:08.368 --> 00:00:11.428
Cozlin held up her hand, but nothing happened.

3
00:00:11.429 --> 00:00:15.937
"I don't have my super powers either!"

4
00:00:15.938 --> 00:00:20.825
The robots moved closer.

5
00:00:20.826 --> 00:00:25.219
Cozlin grabbed Roxy and pulled her into a small opening in the wall.

6
00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:28.391
"Follow me!" Cozlin said.

7
00:00:28.392 --> 00:00:31.371
They crawled through a narrow tunnel.

8
00:00:31.372 --> 00:00:34.861
It was too small for any of those robots to enter.

9
00:00:34.862 --> 00:00:38.519
The floor was slippery with thick, dark sludge.

10
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:42.581
"There's something on the floor," Roxy said.

11
00:00:42.582 --> 00:00:49.073
"It's motor oil," Cozlin said. "Maybe oil drains into this tunnel."

12
00:00:49.074 --> 00:00:52.917
"Yuck!" Roxy said.

13
00:00:52.918 --> 00:00:56.182
They reached a small chamber and stood up.

14
00:00:56.183 --> 00:00:59.539
"That was close," Cozlin said.

15
00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:05.075
Roxy frowned. "We're covered in motor oil!"

16
00:01:05.076 --> 00:01:09.911
Cozlin shrugged. "At least we're safe now."

17
00:01:09.912 --> 00:01:13.969
"Safe?" Roxy said. "Are you kidding?

18
00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:19.223
We're trapped in a tunnel a million light-years from home without super powers!

19
00:01:19.224 --> 00:01:22.287
And we're covered in motor oil!"

20
00:01:22.288 --> 00:01:27.994
Cozlin rolled her eyes. "This is why I work alone.

21
00:01:27.995 --> 00:01:32.498
I don't have to listen to people who complain."

22
00:01:32.499 --> 00:01:36.436
"I wish you were working alone!" Roxy said.

23
00:01:36.437 --> 00:01:39.764
"Because then I'd be at home right now!

24
00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:45.222
I'm only here because of you. You terrorized Metro City.

25
00:01:45.223 --> 00:01:49.014
You dragged me all the way out here.

26
00:01:49.015 --> 00:01:52.507
You said it was fine to go through that energy shield.

27
00:01:52.508 --> 00:01:56.029
And now I'm covered in motor oil!"

28
00:01:56.030 --> 00:02:02.500
Cozlin folded her arms. "You already complained about that part."

29
00:02:02.501 --> 00:02:06.023
"Grr!" Roxy stamped her foot.

30
00:02:06.024 --> 00:02:11.509
Cozlin frowned. "Let's just figure out how to get out of here."

31
00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:17.160
"Yes," Roxy said. "And then I'll figure out how to get home."

32
00:02:17.161 --> 00:02:23.403
"Fine," Cozlin said. "I can handle the robots on my own."

33
00:02:23.404 --> 00:02:29.540
"Good," Roxy said. "They're not my problem anyway."

34
00:02:29.541 --> 00:02:32.120
"That's right," Cozlin said.

35
00:02:32.121 --> 00:02:35.964
"And if one of them goes to Earth, I won't have to help you.

36
00:02:35.965 --> 00:02:40.101
It'll be your problem and not mine."

37
00:02:40.102 --> 00:02:43.359
Roxy remembered what Eldin had said.

38
00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:46.879
The robots had taken over every planet they invaded.

39
00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:51.782
It was only a matter of time before one arrived on Earth.

40
00:02:51.783 --> 00:02:56.834
She sighed. "You're right.

41
00:02:56.835 --> 00:03:04.488
Let's figure out how to get out of here and stop those robots."

42
00:03:04.489 --> 00:03:11.360
They crawled through another tunnel and arrived in a hallway that sloped upward.

43
00:03:11.361 --> 00:03:14.811
"We're heading back to the surface," Roxy said.

44
00:03:14.812 --> 00:03:18.807
Suddenly the walls around them began to shift and change shape.

45
00:03:18.808 --> 00:03:21.361
An arm popped out.

46
00:03:21.362 --> 00:03:28.588
Cozlin gulped. "The walls are turning into robots!"

47
00:03:28.589 --> 00:03:32.923
They ran up the hallway as robots stomped after them.

48
00:03:32.924 --> 00:03:39.036
Roxy pointed ahead of them. "There's that energy shield again!"

49
00:03:39.037 --> 00:03:44.057
They ran through the shield, and right away Roxy felt different.

50
00:03:44.058 --> 00:03:49.721
Whiz-hoo! Her eye laser beams blasted a robot that had just stepped through the energy shield.

51
00:03:49.722 --> 00:03:52.695
"Yes!" Roxy cried.

52
00:03:52.696 --> 00:03:58.406
Cozlin grinned as she blasted the next robot.

53
00:03:58.407 --> 00:04:05.170
Soon the two heroes had destroyed every robot.

54
00:04:05.171 --> 00:04:08.631
Boom! The wall behind them exploded.

55
00:04:08.632 --> 00:04:12.015
They spun around to see a much bigger robot.

56
00:04:12.016 --> 00:04:14.756
"Uh-oh," Cozlin said.

57
00:04:14.757 --> 00:04:17.183
Roxy got ready to fight.

58
00:04:17.184 --> 00:04:19.910
Then she heard Cozlin's device beep.

59
00:04:19.911 --> 00:04:23.706
The beeping got faster and louder.

60
00:04:23.707 --> 00:04:27.101
"Something is alive here," Cozlin said.

61
00:04:27.102 --> 00:04:34.273
A familiar—but angry—voice came from the robot. "Rocket Girl?"

62
00:04:34.274 --> 00:04:37.842
Roxy scratched her head. "Huh?"

63
00:04:37.843 --> 00:04:43.021
The robot's head opened.

64
00:04:43.022 --> 00:04:52.875
Dr. Odd sat inside.

